# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for build/tsan/embed_concurrent (tests/test_tsan.sh).
# Every entry needs a reason, and test_tsan.sh asserts each one MATCHED on
# the run (an unused suppression means the case it covers stopped running).
#
# planted_worker: test_planted_fault_is_detectable races on a file-scope
# global ON PURPOSE. It is the harness's control, proving that a shared
# global does cross-talk under this scheduler, so the isolation checks above
# it are informative. The race is the point; suppressing it is what lets the
# embed row fail on every OTHER report (#1334).
race:planted_worker
